{"id":"466958bfe2025da6","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-cor-hahn-banach.md","title":"Hahn–Banach Corollary","display":"cor-hahn-banach — Hahn–Banach Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-hahn-banach","aliases":["58-cor-hahn-banach"],"display":"cor-hahn-banach — Hahn–Banach Corollary","depends_on":["[[58-ax-ac]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-sublinear]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-hahn-banach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-hahn-banach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-hahn-banach — Hahn–Banach Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"58-ax-ac\">58-ax-ac</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1191b8d1afa11034\" href=\"?note=1191b8d1afa11034\" title=\"58-df-sublinear\">58-df-sublinear</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,E,+_E,+_U,\\odot_E,\\odot_U,p,f\\in V\">\\(U,E,+_E,+_U,\\odot_E,\\odot_U,p,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(U,+_U,\\odot_U)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(U,+_U,\\odot_U)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq E\">\\(U\\subseteq E\\)</span>, and the operations on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> are the restrictions of those on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,E,+_E,\\odot_E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1191b8d1afa11034\" href=\"?note=1191b8d1afa11034\" title=\"58-df-sublinear\">58-df-sublinear</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit linear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hahn\\text{-}banach} \\vdash \\Bigl[\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\land U\\subseteq E\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(U,+_U,\\odot_U)\\land\\forall u,v\\in U\\;(u+_Uv=u+_Ev)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(a\\odot_Uu=a\\odot_Eu)\\land\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,U,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_U,\\odot_U,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;(f(u)\\leq p(u))\\Bigr]\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(F,E,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_E,\\odot_E,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\\land F\\upharpoonright U=f\\land\\forall v\\in E\\;(F(v)\\leq p(v))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hahn\\text{-}banach} \\vdash \\Bigl[\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\land U\\subseteq E\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(U,+_U,\\odot_U)\\land\\forall u,v\\in U\\;(u+_Uv=u+_Ev)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(a\\odot_Uu=a\\odot_Eu)\\land\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,U,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_U,\\odot_U,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;(f(u)\\leq p(u))\\Bigr]\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(F,E,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_E,\\odot_E,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\\land F\\upharpoonright U=f\\land\\forall v\\in E\\;(F(v)\\leq p(v))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hahn–Banach theorem extends linear functionals.</li>\n<li>It requires some form of AC for infinite dimensions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-ac","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-ac]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sublinear","status":"resolved","id":"1191b8d1afa11034","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sublinear]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)$ and $\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(U,+_U,\\odot_U)$ (see [[58-df-vector-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sublinear","status":"resolved","id":"1191b8d1afa11034","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,E,+_E,\\odot_E)$ (see [[58-df-sublinear]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S$ (fully explicit linear-map predicate, see [[58-df-linear-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,E,+_E,+_U,\\odot_E,\\odot_U,p,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(U,+_U,\\odot_U)","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,E,+_E,\\odot_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hahn\\text{-}banach} \\vdash \\Bigl[\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\land U\\subseteq E\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(U,+_U,\\odot_U)\\land\\forall u,v\\in U\\;(u+_Uv=u+_Ev)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(a\\odot_Uu=a\\odot_Eu)\\land\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,E,+_E,\\odot_E)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,U,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_U,\\odot_U,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;(f(u)\\leq p(u))\\Bigr]\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(F,E,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_E,\\odot_E,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\\land F\\upharpoonright U=f\\land\\forall v\\in E\\;(F(v)\\leq p(v))\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-cor-hahn-banach.md|58-cor-hahn-banach]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["b3dac4cf78c440c7","592f9cfb66a507c2","f67456d74b418241","1191b8d1afa11034"]}